# Transient agent session artifacts.
#
# Do NOT ignore the whole .air/ or .junie/ namespaces: both may contain durable,
# shareable project configuration that is intended to be versioned (e.g. worktree
# setup, Docker environment, MCP configuration, and review prompts under .air/;
# Skills and other project-scoped agent configuration under .junie/).
#
# Ignore only narrowly-scoped, evidence-backed transient paths. Currently the only
# artifacts observed under these namespaces are per-session plan files.
.air/plans/
.junie/plans/
